            0.819
          ],
          "content": "**A pinch of history**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.112,
            0.82,
            0.835,
            0.867
          ],
          "content": "A full turn has been divided into $3 6 0 ^ { \\circ }$ . Why 360? The reason why we use $3 6 0 ^ { \\circ }$ today is not fully known. The division of a circle into"
